<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Security Capital lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Security Capital lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it lowered its rating on the shares of Security Capital Atlantic to outperform from strong buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 7/16 to 2-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
